diag(min10): probe the virtual framebuffer alias BEFORE TTBR0 goes, renumber the post-TTBR0 blocks

min9 (kernel 0344, no herostop) stays frozen on the stages page with blocks up to 19 and no panic text: either the CPU hangs between block 19 and the first draw through the new alias, or the alias does not display. Before apagar TTBR0 (a) write a pixel through the virtual alias, read it back through the physical mapping and draw the verdict (green = same memory, red = different) as block 20; a fault would be drawn as a panic by the physical alias; (b) relocate the early drawing to the alias and draw block 21 through it while TTBR0 still maps the physical alias. The old blocks 20-27 become 22-29 (0343 numbering +2), same places in the code.

